Source data

The tables are built from data published by others, and that data stays under
its publishers' terms. When you reuse a table, credit the original source as
well: each chart names it, and data_inventory.csv lists every source file.
The Australian Bureau of Statistics and Jobs and Skills Australia publish under
CC BY 4.0 (Jobs and Skills Australia asks for "© Commonwealth of Australia").
Check the terms of the other sources (Home Affairs, NCVER, the Department of
Education, the Treasury, the World Bank, the UK Office for National Statistics,
Statistics Canada and the US Census Bureau) before reusing their data.
